  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline;\">At Bamboo Story, we craft more than just bicycles; we build bridges to a sustainable future. Founded by Kiran Agadi, our company is dedicated to transforming the way we think about mobility and environmental responsibility. We specialize in manufacturing bamboo bicycles, each meticulously handmade to reflect our commitment to quality and eco-friendliness. Our vision extends beyond production&mdash;by sourcing bamboo directly from local farmers, we not only support agricultural communities but also help generate rural employment. This initiative empowers local craftsmen by providing them the opportunity to skillfully craft each cycle, fostering both economic growth and sustainability. At Bamboo Story, we are more than a bicycle company; we are a movement towards a greener, more connected world.</span> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Introducing our high-quality Bamboo Towels from Bamboo Story, meticulously crafted from a blend of exclusive Bamboo Fibers and cotton. This combination makes them exceptionally soft, absorbent, and durable. The use of TFO yarn results in a bulky texture that enhances the ultra-soft feel, making these towels skin-friendly and highly absorbent.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bamboo fibers are naturally soft and lustrous, giving these towels a shiny, luxurious appearance. The colors used for dyeing are OEKO-Tex certified, ensuring they are safe and environmentally friendly. A unique feature of these towels is their ability to remain fresh even after multiple uses. Thanks to bamboo's natural properties, they resist odors, even if not dried properly, ensuring they smell fresh all the time.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">www.bamboostoryindia.com&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull; Payment terms</span></strong>:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">UPI, Creadit Card, Paytam&nbsp;</span></p>",
